### EasyTier (optional LAN/tunnel sidecar)

- Project: EasyTier — https://github.com/EasyTier/EasyTier
- Version used by the design: **2.7.0** (fixed version; SHA-256 is verified)
- License: **LGPL-3.0**
- How it is used: as a **separate executable process** (`easytier-core`),
  downloaded at runtime from the official release after user consent. It is
  **not** linked into this application, **not** modified, and **not** bundled
  by default. Users may replace it with their own build/path.
- LGPL-3.0 text and source location are provided alongside the component
  (`dataRoot/modules/link/licenses/EasyTier-LICENSE.txt` when installed), and
  the project source is available at the URL above (version tag `v2.7.0`).
- The application's own GPL-3.0 license and EasyTier's LGPL-3.0 are compatible;
  see `docs/02-compliance-security.md` §6.6.

### authlib-injector (optional third-party account support)

- Project: authlib-injector — https://github.com/yushijinhun/authlib-injector
- Version used in acceptance: **1.2.8** (fixed version; SHA-256 verified)
- License: **AGPL-3.0 with an explicit exception** that permits unmodified
  binary distribution and Java Agent loading.
- How it is used: downloaded at runtime from the official release and loaded as
