### PCL2 (Plain Craft Launcher 2)

- PCL2 is **not open source**; its distribution license authorizes only
  **verbatim copies** and does not grant modification or derivative rights.
- No PCL2 source code (or decompiled code) is copied, ported, or redistributed
  in this project. Behavioral comparison is black-box; where behavior specs are
  used, they are authored by a separate spec author and the implementation does
